{"id": "ozaria_home.speech_bubble_testimonial_2_blockquote", "category": "ozaria_home", "en": "It’s the most accessible programming site I’ve seen as of yet. I appreciate the story that goes with Ozaria, as it aligns with a mission my students can empathize with. Frankly, I love it. In fact, I found myself playing for far longer than I wish to admit last weekend!", "zh_CN": "“这是最容易上手代码编程教学平台，我非常喜欢奥佳睿科幻探险故事，故事中体现的创新、坚韧和卓越精神和我们培养学生的目标高度一致。香港特区有大量中小学试用了奥佳睿教学平台，效果非常好！学生们爱不释手，下了课也不想离开机房！”", "group_id": "818517c3674abf20"}
